# SfxLab family v2: layer id name type dur seed key=value... (dur 0 = endless) · range id param lo hi [note] · bind signal id|* param [lo hi] [rel] [steps=N | scale=<chord>] · note text · then `spell <id>` sections: name, recipe, the spell's layers at their lock values, its binds and notes
bench 1
root 65.4064
# voltaic_arc: voltaic on the arc primitive. A hollow mains hum, four arcs that sputter at random until the ratios lock and then sing,
# single sparks that quicken into a buzz, a corona hiss and a lifted surge that follow the pen. Dry, close, erratic until locked.
