range hum level 0.11 0.15 the mains hum at C2: a sine with a hollow harmonic bank (even harmonics faded), synthesized so it holds steady. The only bass.
range swell level 0.08 0.18 the discovery drone (F1 -48c) lifted to C3, sines only: it surges and fades on its own 20 s cycle; in with stir
range root level 0 0.55 C4: an arc firing at the note's rate
range root jitter 0 0.8 the firing's timing: random sputter at coherence 0, a periodic, singing arc at 1
range root misfire 0 0.4 dropped pulses while the reach is wrong (fit)
range third level 0 0.5 E4
range fifth level 0 0.5 G4
range seventh level 0 0.4 Bb4
range sparks level 0.8 1 single sparks: a few a second even at rest, up with stir
range sparks divide 2 6 the spark rate, octaves under C4: 4 a second at coherence 0, 65 a second at 1
range corona level 0 0.12 corona hiss (long random bursts through a soft bandpass): the pen's speed
range arc level 0 0.3 the rise-fall surge lifted to C4 (sines only): the pen's acceleration
range arc ph_pos 0 1 the phaser notch, parked by the orb's curl
range cloud level 0 0.2 a gritty chord at C3, growing with the machine; spells raise it and pick the chord
range cloud voices 4 8
range cloud gather 0.5 1
bind stir hum level 0.15 0.11
bind stack hum level 0 -0.03 rel
bind stir swell level 0.08 0.18
bind orb.radius swell cutoff 0.5 0.9
bind tone.root root level 0 0.55
bind tone.third third level 0 0.5
bind tone.fifth fifth level 0 0.5
bind tone.seventh seventh level 0 0.4
bind coherence root jitter 0.8 0
bind coherence third jitter 0.8 0
bind coherence fifth jitter 0.8 0
bind coherence seventh jitter 0.8 0
bind fit root misfire 0.4 0
bind fit third misfire 0.4 0
bind fit fifth misfire 0.4 0
bind fit seventh misfire 0.4 0
bind orb.radius root cutoff 0.5 1
bind orb.radius third cutoff 0.5 1
bind orb.radius fifth cutoff 0.5 1
bind orb.radius seventh cutoff 0.5 1
bind orb.accel root flicker 0.3 0.9
bind orb.accel fifth flicker 0.3 0.9
bind stir sparks level 0.8 1
bind coherence sparks divide 6 2
bind coherence sparks jitter 1 0.4
bind orb.speed corona level 0 0.12
bind orb.curl corona cutoff 0.6 0.8
bind orb.accel arc level 0 0.3
bind orb.curl arc ph_pos 0 1
bind stack cloud level 0 0.2
bind coherence cloud gather 0.5 1
bind stack cloud voices 4 8
note voltaic_arc (draft, 2026-10-03): voltaic rebuilt on the arc primitive. Compare with voltaic in the family picker (same spells, same ids).
note Every electrical sound is a pulse train of cracks; the ring param turns 50-60 % of each crack into a damped sine an octave over the note (a formant grain),
note which keeps the arc's timing and sputter but takes the top off: raise ring for more synth, lower it for more Tesla coil. The color param darkens what is left.
note notes = four arcs firing at C4 E4 G4 Bb4 (tone.*): at coherence 0 the firing is random (sputter, no pitch), at 1 periodic (the coil sings);
note fit takes the misfires out; the orb's radius opens their filters, its acceleration makes root and fifth flicker.
note sparks = the same primitive divided six octaves down (4 a second), speeding up in octaves and steadying as the ratios lock.
note corona = long random bursts through a bandpass near 2 kHz: a hiss on the pen's speed (it replaces the digital interference recording).
note One-shots: sub thump plus a noise crack on lock, a falling arc zap on accept, an arc winding down on unlock.
note Spells are voltaic's placeholders, re-pointed at these layers.

